      "created_at": "2022-04-28T21:59:59.950Z",
      "cooked": "<p>A) Then that would have shown for me, too, and B) You give FedEx <em>way</em> too much credit.  They’ll take your shipment and then just hold onto it forever, or send it back to you and still take your money.  At best they’ll let you go through the whole shipping process and then throw some indecipherable error code when you try to print your label.</p>",
